name: sim.readCustomTableData
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: dict/list tableData = sim.readCustomTableData(int objectHandle, string tagName)
pythonSynopsis: table tableData = sim.readCustomTableData(int objectHandle, string tagName)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object, sim.handle_scene, sim.handle_app or sim.handle_appstorage
2. tagName: string that identifies the data
outputs:
1. tableData: the data, or an empty array if the custom data is not present
